{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0103","paragraphs":[{"id":"p93aa26afd971-1","text":"楼角初销一缕霞。"},{"id":"pf8b983ce1813-1","text":"淡黄杨柳暗栖鸦。"},{"id":"p4a36e74399eb-1","text":"玉人和月摘梅花。"},{"id":"p6815eb35920e-1","text":"笑拈粉香归洞户，更垂帘幕护窗纱。"},{"id":"p028a158a1ff3-1","text":"东风寒似夜来些。"}]}